        "values": {
          "en": "The **path component** of $x\\in X$ is the set of points of $X$ that can be joined to $x$ by a path; $\\pi_1(X,x_0)$ only involves the path component of $x_0$ (Hatcher p. 28).",
          "zh-CN": "点 $x\\in X$ 的**道路连通分支**是 $X$ 中所有与 $x$ 可由道路相连的点构成的集合；$\\pi_1(X,x_0)$ 只涉及 $x_0$ 所在的道路连通分支（Hatcher 第 28 页）。"
        }
